<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Physician Support started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Physician Support started.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Monday it initiated coverage of Physician Support Systems Inc with a buy rating and a target price of $17 a share.</p>
<p>Analyst Amy Brodsky said she sees Physician Support shares as undervalued compared to peer group averages. She estimated earnings per share growth of about 35 percent over the next several years.  </p>
<p>&quot;We believe the company is well positioned to capitalize on changes occurring in the health care industry and prosper under a managed care environment,&quot; Brodsky said in a report.</p>
<p>Physician Support provides business management services to health care organizations.</p>
<p>Physican Support was up 3/8 at 11-3/4.</p>
<p>	  ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
